00:08:58,542 --> 00:09:05,376
The medical research is tremendous, not only in terms of pharmacology, but various therapies that may be able to work.

108
00:09:05,456 --> 00:09:16,256
And we're seeing great advances in the use of immunotherapy for cancers, for example, that are that we never would have been able to accelerate to the level that we have now without artificial intelligence.

