117
00:09:51,856 --> 00:09:57,776
And if you don't really know what those are, those are you might have heard of Paxlavid, which is used for COVID-19.

118
00:09:58,016 --> 00:10:03,620
It's basically a medication that helps your immune system actually fight the cancer.

119
00:10:03,918 --> 00:10:16,176
And without the types of AI is able to accelerate that tremendously, where today cancer is becoming a chronic disease as opposed to a, you know, in many ways, a death sentence for people.

120
00:10:16,974 --> 00:10:19,812
So AI is incredibly powerful in that space.

121
00:10:20,206 --> 00:10:28,016
