125
00:10:47,296 --> 00:10:47,536
Right.

126
00:10:47,616 --> 00:10:54,816
And the mind is such a powerful thing, too, doctor, that when you Google something, a symptom you're having, lots of scary information can pop up.

127
00:10:54,896 --> 00:11:02,564
And if if AI doesn't shoot out the right information or it's not specific to you, that can, I would imagine, be pretty detrimental to folks.

128
00:11:03,694 --> 00:11:04,256
Absolutely.

129
00:11:04,336 --> 00:11:08,164
And I have to tell you, I've been using AI for about three years now.

